### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"admin"}

### Me
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Menus
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ping
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/demo/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Roles
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/authz/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Orgs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/org
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Users (list)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Users (create)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo","displayName":"Demo User","password":"demo123","orgUnitId":1}

### Users (update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Demo Updated","enabled":true,"orgUnitId":1}

### Users (delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
